  "contentHtml": "<p>&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대 소개 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">-</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">오늘은 내가 다니는 학교</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대학교를 소개하려고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">내가 지금까지 가 본 미국대학</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미시간주립대</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시카고대</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">스탠포드대</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">들의 공통적인 특징이라면 마땅히 교문이라고 할 공간이 없다는 점이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">그래서 그냥 아쉬운 대로 여기를 교문으로 간주하고 싶은데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사실 맞은편에도 학교 시설물이 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국의 대학도시라는 곳은 학교와 지역 주민의 생활공간이 공존하는 형태라고 보면 될 것 같다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/267F923E52F44AE73C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-1) 정문-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_267F923E52F44AE73C62F3\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교문과 담장이 없는 캠퍼스에는 곳곳에 이런 조형물이 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이런 것을 보면서 여기가 대학이구나</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">생각하면 되겠다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/257DB53E52F44AE909\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-2) 교명-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_257DB53E52F44AE9093B04\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이것은 학교의 상징 동물이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이름은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Bob Cat. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">고양이과 동물이고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">우리말로는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">붉은 시라소니</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/222DAA3E52F44AEB2A\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-3) 밥캣-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_222DAA3E52F44AEB2A3DB2\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교는 대단히 넓다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대의 전체 면적은 농장까지 포함하면 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">5,038</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">에이커니까 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">617</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">만평에 이른다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">물론 실제로 학생들이 생활하는 공간이 이렇게 넓지는 않지만</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교 안에 골프장이 있고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">강이 흐르며</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, 3</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">만명을 수용하는 스타디움이 있으니까 한국의 대학과 비교하면 엄청나게 넓다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실제로 처음에 학교에 왔을 때는 운전을 하면서도 학교 안에서 헤맸다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학생 수는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">34,225</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기는 내가 눈만 뜨면 찾아가는 도서관</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. Alkek Library</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. Alkek</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">은 옛날에 여기 총장하시면서 학교의 발전을 위해 공헌하신 분이라고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사진을 멀리서 찍은 것이고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실제 건물은 학교 안에서 가장 클 것 같다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24154F3E52F44AED01\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-4) Alek library-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_24154F3E52F44AED013977\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 분은 텍사스주립대가 자랑하는 인물</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">린든 베인스 존슨 대통령이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 학교 출신으로 처음에는 초등학교 교사를 하다가 정계에 입문하여 부통령 시절에 존 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">F. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">케네디가 암살당하면서 대통령직을 물려받았고</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이후 재선에도 성공하신 분이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 분의 후임 대통령은 워터게이트 사건으로 유명한 리차드 닉슨이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/21275F3E52F44AEF2B\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-5) LJB동상-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_21275F3E52F44AEF2BD24F\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기는 내가 전공수업을 듣는 교육대학이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기 건물들은 대체로 이렇게 크지만</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가끔씩은 그렇지 않은 건물들이 섞여 있어서 조화를 이루는 것 같다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2722673E52F44AF02F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-6) 교육대학-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2722673E52F44AF02F6E8A\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예를 들어 저런 목조건물은 동문회관이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국에 와서 가장 마음에 드는 집들은 저렇게 생긴 집들이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저렇게 지은 개인주택을 보면 정말 들어가서 살고 싶다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/276F4D3E52F44AF210\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-7) 동문회관-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_276F4D3E52F44AF21097C5\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">도서관과 학생회관 사이의 사각형 지대를 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Quad</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">라고 부른다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">어느 대학이던 학생들이 제일 많은 곳이 이런 곳일 것 같다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2754C04552F44AF617\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-8) quad-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2754C04552F44AF6177E41\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">국기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">” </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">&#8211; </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">주기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">” - </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">텍사스주립대학</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">“</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교기</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">”</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">가 나란히 펄럭이고 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/242A964552F44AF822\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-9) 깃발-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_242A964552F44AF822FF69\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교내에서 예쁜 건물로 손꼽힐만한 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">JCK</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">샌마커스 강물이 흐르는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저 강물에 오리들이 떠다닌다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/24635D4552F44AFA11\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-10) JCK-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_24635D4552F44AFA111C42\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교 안에는 건물만 있는 것이 아니라 이렇게 잠깐 눈을 돌리면 멋진 산책로가 조성되어 있기도 하다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2766CC4552F44AFC0F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-11) 산책로-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2766CC4552F44AFC0FD618\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이 동상은 텍사스 카우보이의 기원으로 불리는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Vaquero</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">뒤에 보이는 붉은 지붕의 건물은 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1899</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">년에 이 학교가 세워졌을 때부터 있었던 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Old main</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2466B84552F44AFE10\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-12) Vaquero-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2466B84552F44AFE1081C1\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기는 서클룸이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">카파알파라는 저 서클은 활동을 꽤 열심히 하는데</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">교내에는 비슷한 이름의 서클들이 몇 개 있다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">저런 서클에 들어가면 미국 문화를 이해하는데 많은 도움이 된다고 해서 내가 들어가 보려고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/265B6E4552F44B0014\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-13) 카파알파-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_265B6E4552F44B00144B98\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">여기는 총장공관</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">평소에는 문이 닫혀 있지만</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">외부에서 손님이 왔을 때는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">층에서 연회를 연다고 한다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2271334552F44B040C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-14) 총장공관-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2271334552F44B040C1471\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">아트센터</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/22369B4252F44B082F\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-15) 아트센터-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_22369B4252F44B082FD644\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">음악당</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cfile/cafe/2541FC4252F44B0B2C\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"512\" style=\"clear: none; float: none;\" border=\"0\" vspace=\"1\" hspace=\"1\" actualwidth=\"512\" exif=\"{}\" data-filename=\"14-16) 음악당-수정.jpg\"  id=\"A_2541FC4252F44B0B2CA889\"/></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p><!--StartFragment-->\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">하루 날 잡아서 물병 들고 돌아다니면서 카메라에 모습을 담았다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">참</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">... </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학교가 좋구나</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">생각했다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">사족</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">1) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">존슨 대통령은 이런 말씀을 남기셨다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">Our society will not be great until every young mind is set free to scan the farthest reaches of thought and imagination.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\">&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p class=\"0\" style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2) </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">미국 대학의 학번은 한국하고 다르다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">예를 들어 나는 </span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">A04380805</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">. 14</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학번이 아니다</span><span style=\"background: rgb(255, 255, 255); letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: 굴림체; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">.</span></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
